  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: avro 1.9.2.rhlw-00002",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released org.apache.avro:avro 1.9.2.rhlw-00002 with backported fixes for CVE-2024-47561 and CVE-2025-33042.\n\nCVE-2024-47561: Apache Avro Java SDK: Arbitrary Code Execution when reading Avro schema (Java SDK)\n\nCVE-2025-33042: Apache Avro Java SDK: Code injection on Java generated code\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for org.apache.avro:avro 1.9.2 from Maven Central.",
